sequenceDiagram
    participant CeleryBeat as Celery Beat
    participant Task as Celery Task
    participant ReminderService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant PushService
    participant FCM as Firebase Cloud Messaging
    actor User

    CeleryBeat->>+Task: Trigger check_meal_reminders<br/>(every 15 min)
    Task->>Task: Create fresh DB session

    Task->>+ReminderService: check_meal_reminders(session)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over ReminderService,DB: Step 1: Find Eligible Users
        ReminderService->>+DB: SELECT users with<br/>meal_reminders_enabled = true<br/>from NotificationPreference
        DB-->>-ReminderService: List of users
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over ReminderService,FCM: Step 2: Check & Notify
        loop For each eligible user
            ReminderService->>+DB: Get active NutritionPlan<br/>check for upcoming meals
            DB-->>-ReminderService: Upcoming meal (if any)

            alt Meal within configured lead time
                ReminderService->>+DB: Get user's DeviceTokens
                DB-->>-ReminderService: Device tokens

                ReminderService->>+PushService: send_push(tokens, title, body)
                PushService->>+FCM: Send push notification
                FCM-->>-PushService: Delivery status
                PushService-->>-ReminderService: Sent
            end
        end
    end

    ReminderService-->>-Task: Complete
    Task-->>-CeleryBeat: Done

    FCM-->>User: Push notification on device
